name: fraud_voucher
title: "Voucher / EVD runbook"
summary: "Detects: redemptions of one voucher serial, above `threshold` (default 1: a serial redeems once)."
steps[4]:
  - text: "Detects: redemptions of one voucher serial, above `threshold` (default 1: a serial redeems once)."
    link:
      kind: dataset
      id: fraud_voucher
  - text: "Check: the voucher platform's log for the serial; the channel that sold it."
  - text: "Act: block the serial and the batch it came from; claw back the credit."
  - text: "Silent by design: a heavy top-up user redeeming many different vouchers."
ownerRole: fraud-analyst
tags[2]: fraud, telco
